msgid "围绕月球的远程**逆行**轨道，稳定性指数接近 1，临界稳定"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/orbit-families.md d921243220294c9fa6a495dbd054891f
msgid "DPO（Direct Prograde Orbit）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/orbit-families.md eee07760bf3b415c9f05c21ca045b3fd
msgid "围绕月球的**顺行**轨道"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/orbit-families.md:31 e63d03f9346749e599ec4662f3348d54
#, python-brace-format
msgid "DRO 在任务设计中很常用：大幅 DRO 在真实星历中可维持数月至数年有界，保持 代价低（见 {doc}`station-keeping`）。"
msgstr ""

